# Breadboard Robot
The breadboard robot is a simple-as-possible robot that is built using breadboards and 3D printed parts.
- No soldering necessary
- Reference 3D printed parts are available, but students are encouraged to design their own parts
- Students are encouraged to add their own capabilities to the robot. 

## Remote Control robot
Students are walked through how to create a remote control breadboard robot. This relies on the companion project:
breadboard joystick controller. The program uses the orbit library.

